{{{{{1<noinclude>|Ability data</noinclude>}}}|Plasma Fission|{{{2|}}}|{{{3|}}}|{{{4|}}}|{{{5|}}}
|champion     = Vel'Koz
|skill        = Q
|blurb        = {{sbc|Active:}} {{ci|Vel'Koz}} fires a plasma bolt that deals {{as|magic damage}} to the first enemy hit, {{tip|slow|slowing}} them for a short time.<br/>
''Plasma Fission'' can be recast while the bolt is in flight, and does so automatically upon hitting an enemy or reaching max range.
|blurb2       = {{sbc|Recast:}} The bolt splits in two, each firing in perpendicular opposite directions.
|blurb3       = Whenever ''Plasma Fission'' kills an enemy, '''Vel'Koz''' restores {{sti|mana|{{as|mana}}}}.
|icon         = Plasma Fission.png
|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Vel'Koz''' fires a plasma bolt in the target direction that deals {{as|magic damage}} to the first enemy hit and {{tip|slow|slows}} them by 70% decaying over a duration.<br/><br>
''Plasma Fission'' can be recast after {{fd|0.25}} seconds while the bolt is in flight, and does so automatically upon hitting an enemy or reaching maximum range.
|leveling     = {{st|Magic Damage|{{ap|80 to 240}} {{as|(+ 90% AP)}}}}
{{st|Slow Duration|{{ap|1 to 2.6}} seconds}}
|icon2        = Plasma Fission 2.png
|description2 = {{sbc|Recast:}} '''Vel'Koz''' splits the bolt in two {{tt|over {{fd|0.25}} seconds|Estimated}}, each part firing perpendicularly in opposite directions and applying the same effects to enemies hit.
|description3 = Whenever ''Plasma Fission'' kills an enemy, '''Vel'Koz''' restores {{sti|mana|{{as|mana}}}}.
|leveling3    = {{st|Mana Restored per Kill|{{as|{{ap|20 to 30}}|mana}}|Maximum Mana Restored|{{as|{{ap|20*3 to 30*3}}|mana}}}} 
|cost         = {{ap|40 to 60}}
|costtype     = Mana
|cooldown     = 7
|cdstart      = on-cast
|range        = {{dv|{{tip|cr|icononly = true}} {{tt|1100|Primary missile range}}|{{tt|1100|Split missile range}}}}
|width        = {{dv|{{tip|er|icononly = true}} {{tt|100|Primary missile width}}|{{tt|90|Split missile width}}}}
|speed        = {{dv|{{tt|1300|Primary missile speed}}|{{tt|2100|Split missile speed}}}}
|cast time    = {{fd|0.25}}
|targeting    = {{dv|[[Direction-targeted|Direction]]|[[Auto-targeted|Auto]]}}
|affects      = Enemies
|damagetype   = Magic
|spellshield  = True
|spelleffects = Area of Effect
|projectile   = True
|grounded     = 
|knockdown    = 
|notes        = 
* The initial cast counts as an ability activation for the purposes of on-cast effects such as {{tip|Spellblade}} and triggering {{ais|Force Pulse|Kassadin}} passive.
** Detonating the ability manually does not.
* ''Plasma Fission's'' damage applies before ''{{ais|Organic Deconstruction|Vel'Koz}}''.
** This also ensures '''Vel'Koz''' does not lose ''Plasma Fission's'' restoration effect.
* An enemy cannot be hit by multiple bolts even when having blocked one with a {{tip|spell shield}}.
* The split occurs at a location 55 units in front of the primary bolt's final location.
* ''Plasma Fission'' can reach a maximum 1595 units diagonally (ignoring the split missile's width and enemy hitbox radius), reaching this distance after a total of about ~{{fd|1.65}} seconds.{{Effect at cast time end}}
}}

